Z||000055||qwikgta||09-24-2001||09:49 PM||||Well in all fairness...wantabe Formula is close..but I did it way before I found the forum and never thought anyone would care that I did it anyway.  I had on a set of black GT rims and a wing off a GT.  Other than the Formula stickers it looked just like a Formula.  One day a bud said "If you added Formula stickers it'd look just like a Formula".  I put on the black ones cause they never put black on red Formulas that I know of.  I admit its not a Formula and I never say it is.  I do have a Formula rear swaybar on it and with the Poly/KYBs and 16" rims it does drive well.  Someday I plan an upgrade to the engine, then it will be better than a Formula.  Not that I am dis'ing the Formulas..Id love to have on too.  <P>But Rice...  Not sure about that one.  I do have a supertrapp on the back, some have said its rice but I don't agree.  Supertrapps were around long b4 rice.  I had them on my Trans AM GTA and even on this car it sounds great.  Not high RPM rice just good deep sound.<P>Now that I am calmer from reading the stupid post that you and Shaun added, I only want to add that we all should post when we have something constructive to add, or to help someone when they have a question.  I have never posted to disrespect someones ride unless they have attacked my ride first.  We all share a common interest, some GT, some coupe, some V6 still others 4cyl.  But we are all Fiero owners.  <P>Rob<P>PS...Shawn posted b4 I could get back to Black88.  Hey Shawn, go stick your "Debby does Dallas" tape in your VCR and suck on your NITROUS bottle...Porn boy.  BTW don't bother posting anymore here, I will not be reading this thread anymore..If I don't read it, I won't have to read your crap anymore.  Oh yea, the reason I want to move to a 3800 is that 240+ HP is a lot better than 98.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fawk.gif">  <P>[This message has been edited by qwikgta (edited 09-24-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by qwikgta (edited 09-24-2001).]||||reg||1
